  "six_secret_sauce_rules": {
    "1_five_spurt_six_gap_audio_weaving": "Slice Track A2 Intro VO into 5 vocal spurts separated by 6 Crash Gaps (Gap #1: 1.80s after greeting; Gap #2: 1.00s visual / 0.44s VO pause after 'OF CHAOS,'; Gap #3: 0.68s visual / 0.80s VO pause after 'FAILS,'; Gap #4: 0.70s full silence after Sentence 1; Gap #5: 0.87s full silence before CTA; Gap #6: 1.02s full silence after CTA before Warning). Unmask Track A1 to 0 dB (or -5..-10 dB on micro-gaps) during every gap.",
    "2_sub_scene_caption_blanking": "Track V8 Komika Axis phrase cards MUST terminate at the exact frame physical impact begins (Part B crash window). Never leave text overlays sitting over the frame during explosions or high-velocity impacts (S01b, S04b, S05b, S09, S13, S14b).",
    "3_semantic_visual_lyric_sync": "Map teaser clips semantically to the spoken words on Track A2/V8: 'OF CHAOS' -> explosion/fireball; 'FAILS' -> head-smash/slapstick; 'AND MASSIVE REGRETS' -> groin impact on pole/rail; 'TURN YOUR DAY AROUND' -> car/dashcam collision; 'GRAB A SEAT' -> chair/ledge wipeout; 'IS ABOUT TO GO WRONG' -> massive tire/equipment explosion; 'LET'S GET IT ON / STARTED' -> 1st-person POV motorcycle/camera crash.",
    "4_setup_to_impact_internal_jump_cut": "For dashcam/CCTV clips requiring context (S07 -> S08), place a 0.50s (12f @ 23.976fps) calm setup slice immediately followed by an internal jump-cut into the 1.00s-1.10s (24-27f) crash slice of the same source clip, while keeping a single continuous Track V8 caption card spanning across the jump-cut.",
    "5_three_point_impact_zoom_transitions": "Keep all 12 internal montage cuts between S02 and S14 as razor-sharp Hard Cuts. Apply AE.AE_Impact_Warp / AE.Impact_Cross_Zoom (8-10 frames) strictly at 3 structural boundaries: (1) End of Cold-Open Teaser #1b (f_c2_start), (2) Entry into Warning card (warning_start), and (3) Exit from Warning card into Main Body Clip #1 (warning_end).",
    "6_teaser_4_payoff_bridge_loop": "Place the climax explosion of Main Body Clip #1 (itv.kb*.1.mp4) at Teaser #4 (S04a + S04b on 'OF CHAOS'), cutting away right as the subject hits the ground to create an open curiosity loop. Reserve Final Teaser (S14a + S14b) for a 1st-person POV camera-hit jump-scare that triggers the Warning card, then immediately resolve Teaser #4 by playing the full 4-Beat clip (itv.kb*.1.mp4) as Body Clip #1."
  },
